WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.980
I can't enter you.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:06.540
Why not?

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.360
It's the system.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.620
What's that supposed to mean?

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.340
Then we can't do a concert!

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.730
Why-pri!?

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.210
You can't enter us-usa!?

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:18.490
Kuma!

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:19.980
It's the system.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.830
What kind of system-pri!?

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.380
CelePara Pon Pon

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.670
Sophie-san's Special Concert will begin shortly.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.460
Viewers please head to the 15th floor of the concert hall.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.880
Sophie's Concert?

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:37.350
Does that mean Sophie-san has been entered?

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.840
What's going on?

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.990
Idol End-Pri

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.540
Airy Change!

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.860
Gold Airy!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.250
Sophie-sama you're so cute!

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.100
Sophie-sama you're the best!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.080
She's like a Goddess!

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.870
You're so beautiful, Sophie-sama!

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.690
She got a Gold Airy
even though it's not a dream theater...

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:48.360
First Hibiki, then Falulu, now Sophie-usa?

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.580
Amazing! Sophie's the best!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.780
It's no fair!
How do I get those wings!?

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:57.040
By being surrounded by
prodigies of the same level

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.030
her talent has increased exponentially-kuma!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:01.500
That means that her hidden potential

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.320
has been awoken-kuma!

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:06.830
She's pulling further away-pri...

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.620
Just like that time...

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.710
Sophie is and always will be ahead of me-pri.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:16.020
Mirei?

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.660
No matter how hard I try, I'll never surpass her.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:24.330
So what was the point in training so hard-pri!?

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:30.120
No matter how hard I try, it's pointless...

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:32.000
That's not true!

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:37.980
You've done it Sophie-san!

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:40.590
You're Idol rank has increased from

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:43.950
Popular idol to Top Class idol!

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:59.190
We've gotta get them to enter us!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.250
You're right!

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:04.150
CelePara Prince Hour!

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.380
To my viewers I hope you are enjoying CelePara.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:17.420
Hibiki-san?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.540
I have wonderful news for you all.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:28.010
From today, only idols of my rank and above will be able to perform.

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:32.720
Anyone lower than me will be unable to enter.

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:33.880
Eh?

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:35.780
What!?

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.190
Then Lala and everyone can't...

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:39.580
I won't stand for this!

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:44.440
Amazing idols from Foreign PriParas have been invited.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:52.840
It's a system that assures
that only the finest celebrities are allowed.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:54.800
What on earth?

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:59.310
So we can no longer perform?

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.540
Also, one more thing.

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:04.510
I have proven that
I have created the ultimate dream team.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.510
However...

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.220
Shiratama Mikan has been cut,

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.130
and will be replaced by...

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:15.200
The great star from Pamerica PriPara....

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.460
Piyonce!

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:18.620
Huh?
Eh? Is that allowed?

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:19.910
Eh? Is that allowed?

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:23.200
Who is this Piyonce!? Mikan was way better!

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:27.520
And so, for the Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix...

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:31.140
As all other teams cannot enter, it will not be held.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:35.580
Meaning my Dream Team will be holding a solo concert.

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:42.460
The princess team who will be holding a parade

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.270
has been set as these five members.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.130
We can't enter the Spring Dream Gran Prix either?

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.760
They're just doing what they want!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:51.220
As if we'd let this happen-usa!
As if we'd let this happen-kuma!

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:52.900
It's my fault.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.710
No it isn't, Mirei.

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:59.180
Everyone else felt the same way back then.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:02.120
When you took that wager

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:05.650
everyone felt great!

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:08.650
But at that time...

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:13.000
I had to judge as calmly as possible,

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:16.490
without letting my emotions get the best of me,

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:19.910
I ruined PriPara-pri.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.070
Mirei...

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:27.070
Break time will be over in 1 minute.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:30.680
If you don't return to the shop in 1 minute you'll be fired.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.350
We'll be there right away-usa!
We'll be there right away-kuma!

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:35.460
Mirei! You can't think like that!

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.920
We'll be back!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:41.170
See, just like Kuma said, don't let it get to you.

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.660
Mirei, where are you going?

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:49.330
It's my fault, I have to put a stop to this!

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:56.570
Please enjoy my improved Dream Team!

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.820
It's so harsh-nekon.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:01.850
All those idols who can't perform, I feel bad for them-nekon.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:04.120
I'm going shopping.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.960
Thanks for the hard work-nekon.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.340
Thank you.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.320
Hibiki-san!

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.070
What are you trying to pull by stopping everyone from performing!?

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.030
What are you trying to do!?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.740
So you've come.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.800
So you've come.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.100
What are you trying to pull by stopping everyone from performing!?

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.510
What are you trying to do!?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.780
It's not everyone.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:05.510
Only low level idols who don't hold the qualifications to perform.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:08.140
You can't do that!

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:13.100
We're all friends, we're all idols!
That's what makes Pripara so great!

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:15.470
But it's not the PriPara I envisioned.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.890
Let's decide who's right with a Concert.

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.040
Whoever wins can decide the future of PriPara.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.600
You're the one who agreed to this, right?

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:26.960
Yes.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:31.970
Hmm, you lose your sentence ender when you're sad.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.880
Don't bug me!

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:39.560
But excluding us from performing is taking it overboard!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:43.900
By trying our best and performing, that's how we rank up

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.860
and everyone should rank up!

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:46.820
She's right!

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:50.070
We ranked up in the Winter Dream Gran Prix!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.420
You still don't seem to understand...

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:57.380
You only ranked up because you competed against the best.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:02.490
It was all because of the talent of the prodigies, your effort had nothing to do with it.

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:06.390
It all comes down to the talent you're born with.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.110
"Trying hard" is just a fairy tale.

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.440
You're wrong!

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.080
That's not true at all!

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.470
Mirei is right!

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:22.710
You're wrong, wrong wrong!

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:25.890
You are the one who is mistaken, Hibiki-san!

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:27.960
Explain yourself.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:29.730
You bet I will!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.850
Because I believe in it!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:36.980
The PriPara I know
is a place where we're all friends and idols!

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:39.340
So you can't do this!

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:43.240
I won't let you change the PriPara I know and love!

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:50.200
I've told you before
but if we're talking about fond memories of PriPara

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:54.270
my feelings are just as, if not stronger than yours.

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:00.050
Initially I thought you were my greatest enemy.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.660
But it just seems like you're emotional.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:05.840
This conversation is over, I have things to do.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:10.820
We won't lose to you!

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:13.850
We'll return PriPara to how it once was!

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.770
To the PriPara I loved!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:19.860
Even if the concert is in a field or a forest
we'll beat you any time any place!

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.740
And we'll never give up, because we're idols!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.910
I can't believe this!

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.920
Mirei, you aren't quitting being an idol, right?

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.810
Let's think of a way.

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:35.860
Y-Yeah...

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.820
Mirei?

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:42.320
As if I'll sit back let things go their way!

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:46.400
With only the Dream Team and foreign idols,
they'll run out of performers in no time.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:49.980
They'll come crying asking us to perform.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:53.190
You're right.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:57.150
This is the CelePara Entry Counter.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.610
Padonna's going to be late?

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:08.090
I'm at the Pairport,

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:12.330
The plane can't take off because of a sandstorm.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.040
Huh?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:21.170
I was supposed to go to Persailles, where am I-daVinci?

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:25.830
I have an announcement, regarding

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.780
Padonna's planned concert.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.360
Because of a sudden occurrence, the concert has been cancelled.

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:32.900
See, told you so.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:36.720
And so I will be replacing her, this is the system.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:37.940
Huh!?

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:43.380
Scan the my tickets for your cord.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:45.360
Cord Change Start!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:51.050
For glasses lovers, by glasses lovers.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:53.370
A stage cord with plenty of glasses.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.700
Glasses attendant cord!

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.390
It's the system!

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:04.010
Enjoy my concert!

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:25.120
Making Drama, switch on!

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.540
Cyalume Change!

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:37.620
Meganee you're shining!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.460
Amazing, Meganee-san!

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:40.660
She's not bad!

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:42.930
Thank you!

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.890
I have an announcement for everybody!

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:47.920
Please pay attention to the center!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:53.620
This is the prize for the Spring Dream Gran Prix
the Spring Dream Parade Cord.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.580
I want it!
Me too!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:16:00.520
This cord will be given to the Dream Team unconditionally.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.850
You all are just getting to see it.

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:08.280
This is your only chance so take a good look!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.470
Thought so.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:15.290
There's no way we could beat the Dream Team anyway...

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:17.340
Everything is as expected really...

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:19.430
Let's just have a good look.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.710
Mirei!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:28.730
It's Mirei, no doubt she feels responsible and is feeling down.

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:30.930
Hasn't she come to the concert?

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:33.170
Mirei.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.370
I was a bit hesitant at first...

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:42.540
But to be honest just getting to see the Dream Team is good enough.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:43.670
Exactly.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.970
Plus I'm looking forward to seeing the Foreign Top Idols.

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:47.400
Same here.

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.890
Are they really okay with it!?

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:54.080
I wanna perform!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.650
Kyupikon!

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:57.800
Not being able to perform...

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.830
I want to do a concert!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:03.590
The stage is where I shine though!

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:05.290
Thirty-love!

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:09.270
I don't perform, but I still want to see Lala's concerts!

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.590
Make PriPara how it used to be!

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:13.010
Kyupikon!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.470
I can't allow this!

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:16.880
I won't allow it!

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.050
We can perform anywhere-nanon!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.310
Very true-dearu.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:24.100
She's right!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:27.470
Down with CelePara!

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:28.610
Kyupikon!
Down with CelePara!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.570
I want to perform!

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.780
We want to perform!

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:37.050
We're all friends!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:38.740
Ahhh.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:41.380
If only Mirei had promised something else at that time,

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:43.300
none of this would have...

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.170
Eh?

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.840
Eh!?

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:51.990
Sorry, everyone.

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:56.800
All this happened because I accepted that challenge.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.140
Mirei-chan!

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.060
I'm sorry!

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.650
I was just joking, don't be upset!

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:02.990
Mirei!

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.030
There you are.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.220
Shion, Sophie.

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:09.380
I was surprised when I saw you on TV.

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:11.690
I never thought this would happen.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:14.340
Even you guys didn't know?

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:15.290
No.

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:19.740
But we'll definitely change Shikyouin's mind.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.320
Just give us a while.

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:22.190
Okay.

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.540
We're on your side, Mirei.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:28.640
Get off me!

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:29.470
Mirei!?

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:31.700
Pshhuuuu

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:34.060
S-Sorry, Sophie.

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:35.840
Sorry.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:39.540
Mirei, wait!

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:42.670
Mirei!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.010
Mirei-kuma?

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:48.700
What happened-usa?

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:04.380
Mirei, where are you going?

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:05.340
Mirei...

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:06.900
Mirei.

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:07.700
Mirei...

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.050
Mirei-chan...

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:12.680
I'm quitting being an idol.

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:15.710
Eh!?

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:19.190
I judged it all wrong.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.230
I can't forgive myself for that.

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:25.130
I can't forgive myself for that!

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:26.280
It's not like that!

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:27.770
I'm sorry for what I said earlier!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.770
I know how you feel.

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:34.000
I thought the same thing!
I was going to do it too.

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:35.340
Me too-dearu.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:36.720
Please don't go-nanon!

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:39.930
Mirei!~

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:41.460
The game isn't over yet!

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:43.070
Please rethink your decision!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.100
Thanks...

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.960
but it's not just that.

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:52.490
No matter how hard I try it's meaningless,

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:54.670
I get that now.

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.210
Even after saying that you still don't get it.

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:04.630
Get her!

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.160
Mirei...

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.490
Mirei!

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:22.360
Sorry,

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.360
I appreciate your feelings,

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:30.180
but I don't have the willpower anymore...

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:32.250
Farewell.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.010
Mirei!

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:34.360
Wait-nano!

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.600
Are you really leaving!?

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:36.520
Mirei!

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:39.090
Mirei, Mirei!
